":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m016-0414","start":414,"end":416,"surface":"程嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002277","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p018","text":"及趙武冠，爲成人，程嬰乃辭諸大夫，謂趙武曰：「昔下宮之難，皆能死。我非不能死，我思立趙氏之後。今趙武旣立，爲成人，復故位，我將下報趙宣孟與公孫杵臼。」趙武啼泣頓首固請，曰：「武願苦筋骨以報子至死，而子忍去我死乎！」程嬰曰：「不可。彼以我爲能成事，故先我死；今我不報，是以我事爲不成。」遂自殺。趙武服齊衰三年，爲之祭邑，春秋祠之，世世勿絶。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m018-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"趙武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m018-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"程嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002277","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m018-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"趙武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m018-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"趙武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m018-0065","start":65,"end":68,"surface":"趙宣孟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m018-0069","start":69,"end":73,"surface":"公孫杵臼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002276","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m018-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"趙武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m018-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"程嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002277","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m018-0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"趙武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002278","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:p002","text":"韓厥，晉景公之三年，晉司寇屠岸賈將作亂，誅靈公之賊趙盾。趙盾已死矣，欲誅其子趙朔。韓厥止賈，賈不聽。厥告趙朔令亡。朔曰：「子必能不絶趙祀，死不恨矣。」韓厥許之。及賈誅趙氏，厥稱疾不出。程嬰、公孫杵臼之藏趙孤趙武也，厥知之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"晉景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002625","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"屠岸賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002626","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002666","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002666","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"趙朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002667","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002626","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002626","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"趙朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002667","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0057","start":57,"end":58,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002667","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0081","start":81,"end":82,"surface":"賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002626","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0083","start":83,"end":85,"surface":"趙氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、對話指代或未名者保留；當前與引語回敘秦王不預接，爭太子不作已授太子，大業不先定祖名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0086","start":86,"end":87,"surface":"厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"程嬰","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002668","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0095","start":95,"end":99,"surface":"公孫杵臼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002627","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0101","start":101,"end":105,"surface":"趙孤趙武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002628","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0107","start":107,"end":108,"surface":"厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","book_id":"b-shiji-045","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-045-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:p036","text":"太史公曰：韓厥之感晉景公，紹趙孤之子武，以成程嬰、公孫杵臼之義，此天下之陰德也。韓氏之功，於晉未睹其大者也。然與趙、魏終爲諸侯十餘世，宜乎哉！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m036-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002664","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m036-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m036-000